flowchart TD
    Client[Customer / Admin / Postman] --> API[Gin REST API]
    API --> Middleware[JWT roles validation request ID]
    Middleware --> Handlers[HTTP handlers and request DTOs]
    Handlers --> Services[Application services and business rules]
    Services --> Repositories[pgx repositories and transactions]
    Repositories --> DB[(PostgreSQL source of truth)]
    Services -. product reads only .-> Redis[(Optional Redis TTL cache)]
    Expiry[Unpaid order expiry worker] --> Services
    Recovery[Mock provider recovery worker] --> Services
    API --> Metrics[/metrics and X-Request-ID/]
    CI[GitHub Actions CI] -. validates commit .-> API
